{"schemaVersion":1,"id":100,"sections":[{"id":"130007-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[20723],"start":0,"count":45},{"id":"130007-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[20724],"start":45,"count":9},{"id":"130008-PROLOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战前","scripts":[20725],"start":54,"count":9},{"id":"130008-EPILOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战后","scripts":[20726],"start":63,"count":11},{"id":"130009-PROLOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战前","scripts":[20727],"start":74,"count":13},{"id":"130009-EPILOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战后","scripts":[20728],"start":87,"count":31}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130007-PROLOGUE:20723:0","scriptId":20723,"text":"由于发现了欧米伽的存在，所以无法就这么放着不管。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130007-PROLOGUE:20723:1","scriptId":20723,"text":"让运输机把嵌合战车兽的遗体直接送去波西娅那边进行分析，而我们则留下协助伊莎贝尔处理旅行者欧米伽。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130007-PROLOGUE:20723:3","scriptId":20723,"text":"桑赫斯特学院——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130007-PROLOGUE:20723:4","scriptId":20723,"text":"“没想到又牵扯到了旅行者，还以为她们自从上次总攻以后就销声匿迹了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1187,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130007-PROLOGUE:20723:5","scriptId":20723,"text":"“如果艾丽莎在的话就好了，能问问旅行者到底在打什么主意。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130007-PROLOGUE:20723:6","scriptId":20723,"text":"“至少就目前情况来书，只能靠我们自己解决。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130007-PROLOGUE:20723:7","scriptId":20723,"text":"“先修整一下吧，今天对付了嵌合战车兽，大家也都累了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130007-PROLOGUE:20723:8","scriptId":20723,"text":"“我这边把机场的报告书先处理了，之后再召集你们讨论对付旅行者的事情。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130007-PROLOGUE:20723:9","scriptId":20723,"text":"说完，伊莎贝尔就先行离开了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130007-PROLOGUE:20723:10","scriptId":20723,"text":"“没想到伊莎贝尔教官还要负责那么多事情啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1190,"speaker":"丹妮丝·奥金莱克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130007-PROLOGUE:20723:11","scriptId":20723,"text":"“也就只是这次的事情比较多，又是嵌合战车兽又是旅行者什么的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":1190,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1191,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130007-PROLOGUE:20723:12","scriptId":20723,"text":"“刚才伊莎贝尔教官已经对我们吩咐过了，发现旅行者的事情不宜外传，等到事情有结果了再说。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":1191,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130007-PROLOGUE:20723:13","scriptId":20723,"text":"“不愧是伊莎贝尔，做事滴水不漏啊，这种时候封锁情报可以避免不必要的混乱。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":1191,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":897,"speaker":"芙琳·勒布","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130007-PROLOGUE:20723:14","scriptId":20723,"text":"“先维护一下舞装吧，可能很快就要面对下次的战斗了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1188,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130007-PROLOGUE:20723:15","scriptId":20723,"text":"“哎...希望这套舞装能坚持到我原舞装维护完毕的时候吧，不然短时间内没办法接任务赚钱…就没办法买限量版香水了呢…”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":1188,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1187,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130007-PROLOGUE:20723:16","scriptId":20723,"text":"“我去学院里逛逛，好久没来了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130007-PROLOGUE:20723:17","scriptId":20723,"text":"“哦，不要紧吧？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1187,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130007-PROLOGUE:20723:18","scriptId":20723,"text":"“嗯？没事，长官不要太操心啦。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130007-PROLOGUE:20723:19","scriptId":20723,"text":"（佩妮已经从被桑赫斯特开除的阴影里走出来了吗？看来死水的生活对她的影响很大啊。）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1191,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130007-PROLOGUE:20723:20","scriptId":20723,"text":"“我们也一起吧，正好带你餐馆下改建的食堂。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":1191,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1190,"speaker":"丹妮丝·奥金莱克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130007-PROLOGUE:20723:21","scriptId":20723,"text":"“嗯，虽然菜色没啥改进，但氛围已经好了很多。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":1190,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130007-PROLOGUE:20723:22","scriptId":20723,"text":"“那今天就先就地解散，别玩得太晚了，我直接回客房休息了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":1190,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130007-PROLOGUE:20723:24","scriptId":20723,"text":"第二天，中午——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130007-PROLOGUE:20723:25","scriptId":20723,"text":"“哈啊……虽然没定集合时间，不过没想到竟然会睡到中午……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130007-PROLOGUE:20723:26","scriptId":20723,"text":"从客房的走廊绕了一圈，准备前往伊莎贝尔的办公室，不过走到一半就撞见了本人。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130007-PROLOGUE:20723:27","scriptId":20723,"text":"“哟，醒了吗？正准备去找你呢。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130007-PROLOGUE:20723:28","scriptId":20723,"text":"“嗯，刚醒……可能昨天有点累，起晚了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130007-PROLOGUE:20723:29","scriptId":20723,"text":"“没事，你的队员们都在打靶场呢，新送来的炮弹测试应该已经完成得差不多了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130007-PROLOGUE:20723:30","scriptId":20723,"text":"“新炮弹？你们的针刺弹吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130007-PROLOGUE:20723:31","scriptId":20723,"text":"“不，是从死水空运过来的新弹药，听说是波西娅连夜研究的产品。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130007-PROLOGUE:20723:32","scriptId":20723,"text":"“诶！？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130007-PROLOGUE:20723:33","scriptId":20723,"text":"于是随着伊莎贝尔一起来到了打靶场。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":897,"speaker":"芙琳·勒布","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130007-PROLOGUE:20723:34","scriptId":20723,"text":"“这冻结弹的精度基本没有问题，和普通的高爆弹装药量相当。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1187,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130007-PROLOGUE:20723:35","scriptId":20723,"text":"“着弹点会产生使黏液凝固的冰晶体，这样就能完美对应嵌合战车兽的棘皮了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":1187,"right":897,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1188,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130007-PROLOGUE:20723:36","scriptId":20723,"text":"“其他附赠的遥控机枪还有填装器也不错，波西娅这次准备的很周到啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":1187,"right":1188,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130007-PROLOGUE:20723:37","scriptId":20723,"text":"“测完以后记得写报告，波西娅可不会白送东西给我们。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":1188,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1188,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130007-PROLOGUE:20723:38","scriptId":20723,"text":"“喔，长官来了啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":1188,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130007-PROLOGUE:20723:39","scriptId":20723,"text":"“看来波西娅还是挺重视我们这次的突发情况，靶场的测试基本完成了吧？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":1188,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1188,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130007-PROLOGUE:20723:40","scriptId":20723,"text":"“新的弹药和装备的整体效果非常好，甚至比针刺弹的杀伤力还要高。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":1188,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130007-PROLOGUE:20723:41","scriptId":20723,"text":"“波西娅博士果然是稀世的天才，我们的研究组弄了半天的成果，还不如她一个通宵……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130007-PROLOGUE:20723:42","scriptId":20723,"text":"“但要伺候她那个古怪的性格可不是一般的头疼。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130007-PROLOGUE:20723:43","scriptId":20723,"text":"“至少从结果上来看，绝对是惊世骇俗的效果。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130007-PROLOGUE:20723:44","scriptId":20723,"text":"“也对，既然送来了哪有不好好利用的道理。全员都装备上了吧？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":897,"speaker":"芙琳·勒布","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130007-PROLOGUE:20723:45","scriptId":20723,"text":"“是的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130007-PROLOGUE:20723:46","scriptId":20723,"text":"“那接下来就准备实战了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130007-EPILOGUE:20724:0","scriptId":20724,"text":"在桑赫斯特的周边区域随便找了一批战车兽，对新弹药进行了实战测试。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130007-EPILOGUE:20724:1","scriptId":20724,"text":"测试结果令人满意，这时就不得不佩服波西娅的研发能力了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130007-EPILOGUE:20724:2","scriptId":20724,"text":"“有了这批新式装备和弹药就可以去和欧米伽比试比试了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130007-EPILOGUE:20724:3","scriptId":20724,"text":"“队伍方面要增加人手吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130007-EPILOGUE:20724:4","scriptId":20724,"text":"“不用，少数精锐为主，和上次的配置一样也能让对手掉以轻心。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130007-EPILOGUE:20724:5","scriptId":20724,"text":"“了解了，这次的指挥还是以你小队为核心。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130007-EPILOGUE:20724:6","scriptId":20724,"text":"“谢了，那么各队做最后的准备检查，十分钟后集合出发。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130007-EPILOGUE:20724:7","scriptId":20724,"text":"“接下来就祈祷欧米伽没有什么太令人棘手的能力吧……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130007-EPILOGUE:20724:8","scriptId":20724,"text":"于是众人调转队伍的方向，前往欧米伽的养殖场。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-100.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130008-PROLOGUE:20725:1","scriptId":20725,"text":"抵达了欧米伽的养殖场周围，发现了大量的嵌合战车兽，还有骸虫。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130008-PROLOGUE:20725:2","scriptId":20725,"text":"数量远比之前的要多得多，仿佛就像是在守护着什么似的。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130008-PROLOGUE:20725:3","scriptId":20725,"text":"“现在开始要进行对旅行者作战，伊莎贝尔教官的队伍负责外围的补漏。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130008-PROLOGUE:20725:4","scriptId":20725,"text":"“喔？让我们做那么轻松的工作？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130008-PROLOGUE:20725:5","scriptId":20725,"text":"“要防范其他旅行者的突然出现，手里留点底牌会好一点。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130008-PROLOGUE:20725:6","scriptId":20725,"text":"“而且虽然旅行者正面作战很强，但她们不擅长多头作战，关键时刻发动突袭能够打乱她们的节奏。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130008-PROLOGUE:20725:7","scriptId":20725,"text":"“嗯，越来越有总指挥的样子了啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130008-PROLOGUE:20725:8","scriptId":20725,"text":"“过奖了，这都是打出来的经验教训……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130008-PROLOGUE:20725:9","scriptId":20725,"text":"在队伍都部署完之后，开始对欧米伽的养殖场发动第一波攻势。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130008-EPILOGUE:20726:0","scriptId":20726,"text":"作战开始了将近一小时，由于波西娅新装备非常有效，嵌合兽完全不是对手。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130008-EPILOGUE:20726:1","scriptId":20726,"text":"纵使有大量战车兽和骸虫进行联合防御，整支队伍依旧势如破竹。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130008-EPILOGUE:20726:2","scriptId":20726,"text":"“奇怪……都那么大动静了，怎么还没看到欧米伽？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":897,"speaker":"芙琳·勒布","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130008-EPILOGUE:20726:3","scriptId":20726,"text":"“欧米伽难道不在？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1187,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130008-EPILOGUE:20726:4","scriptId":20726,"text":"“战车兽和骸虫比第一次来的时候多了不少，或许真的是在负责看门？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":1187,"right":897,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130008-EPILOGUE:20726:5","scriptId":20726,"text":"“运气这么好？给我们闯空门了？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130008-EPILOGUE:20726:6","scriptId":20726,"text":"抱着试试看的想法，加大了攻击力度，并且让伊莎贝尔小队也发动了远程支援。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130008-EPILOGUE:20726:7","scriptId":20726,"text":"结果完全没有欧米伽的影子，反倒是把出现的战车兽和骸虫来了个大清扫……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130008-EPILOGUE:20726:8","scriptId":20726,"text":"“难道欧米伽已经遗弃了这里？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1188,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130008-EPILOGUE:20726:9","scriptId":20726,"text":"“也不是没可能，旅行者经常更换自己的据点吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1188,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130008-EPILOGUE:20726:10","scriptId":20726,"text":"“先打扫战场吧，这里有不少骸虫材料，可以送去给波西娅，估计能赚不少。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1188,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130009-PROLOGUE:20727:1","scriptId":20727,"text":"清扫战场后，准备整队撤退，这时候欧米伽出现了——","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1188,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1195,"speaker":"欧米伽","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"130009-PROLOGUE:20727:2","scriptId":20727,"text":"“瞧瞧你们干得好事！！竟然趁我不在大搞破坏！！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1195,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130009-PROLOGUE:20727:3","scriptId":20727,"text":"欧米伽派出了身边的嵌合战车兽，并且这次她自己也参与了攻击。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1195,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130009-PROLOGUE:20727:6","scriptId":20727,"text":"欧米伽的两门火炮威力非常凶狠，并且她身边有两只特殊的“小家伙”还能发动音波攻击。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1195,"section":4,"shake":true},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130009-PROLOGUE:20727:7","scriptId":20727,"text":"“欧米伽这火力异常猛烈，根本不像是单兵所持有的火力强度。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1195,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130009-PROLOGUE:20727:8","scriptId":20727,"text":"“伊莎贝尔！准备支援火炮，尽量瞄准欧米伽的死角。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1195,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130009-PROLOGUE:20727:9","scriptId":20727,"text":"通过无线电通讯联系到了伊莎贝尔，让其对欧米伽发动攻击。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1195,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130009-PROLOGUE:20727:10","scriptId":20727,"text":"“火炮准备开火，别停手，饱和式轰炸！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130009-PROLOGUE:20727:13","scriptId":20727,"text":"一轮炮击过后，除了部分骸虫受到了些伤害以外，欧米伽几乎毫发无损。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":4,"shake":true},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130009-PROLOGUE:20727:14","scriptId":20727,"text":"“喂喂……这可跟报告里的不太一样吧，这种火力下竟然一点事都没有……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130009-PROLOGUE:20727:15","scriptId":20727,"text":"“这家伙多半也有护盾，需要找到护盾的死角进行攻击，不然根本伤不到她。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130009-PROLOGUE:20727:16","scriptId":20727,"text":"“好的，我尽量。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1195,"speaker":"欧米伽","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"130009-PROLOGUE:20727:17","scriptId":20727,"text":"“就这点水平吗？我真不理解你们是怎么打赢兰布达她们的……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1195,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130009-EPILOGUE:20728:0","scriptId":20728,"text":"一轮交手过后，欧米伽终于受到了一些伤害。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1195,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1187,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130009-EPILOGUE:20728:1","scriptId":20728,"text":"“这家伙太难处理了，那两个在她周围飞舞的小东西也不好对付。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":1187,"right":1195,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130009-EPILOGUE:20728:2","scriptId":20728,"text":"“嗯，从我的观察来看那两个小东西应该就是欧米伽的护盾。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1195,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1188,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130009-EPILOGUE:20728:3","scriptId":20728,"text":"“哈？那两个应该是活物吧？而且她们也在参与攻击啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1188,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130009-EPILOGUE:20728:4","scriptId":20728,"text":"“是的，在欧米伽受到攻击的时候其中一只就会飞回欧米伽的身边。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1188,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130009-EPILOGUE:20728:5","scriptId":20728,"text":"“欧米伽在人数上不占优势，被我们狂轰滥炸的时候两个小东西在来回飞行……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1188,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130009-EPILOGUE:20728:6","scriptId":20728,"text":"“我猜测那两个东西应该是交替使用护盾的，可能有类似冷却之类的机制。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1188,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130009-EPILOGUE:20728:7","scriptId":20728,"text":"“所以长时间轰炸的时候她才会受伤？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130009-EPILOGUE:20728:8","scriptId":20728,"text":"“没错。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130009-EPILOGUE:20728:9","scriptId":20728,"text":"“不过这么一来，我们的弹药可就不够了……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130009-EPILOGUE:20728:10","scriptId":20728,"text":"“现在她的骸虫和嵌合战车兽都已经被我们干掉了，应该可以集中火力了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130009-EPILOGUE:20728:11","scriptId":20728,"text":"“就看是她先倒下，还是我们的弹药先用完了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130009-EPILOGUE:20728:12","scriptId":20728,"text":"就在这时，天空中亮出了一道白光直坠战场的中央。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130009-EPILOGUE:20728:13","scriptId":20728,"text":"“这……难道是兰布达！？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130009-EPILOGUE:20728:14","scriptId":20728,"text":"从白光中出现了一个熟悉的身影。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"130009-EPILOGUE:20728:15","scriptId":20728,"text":"“怎么又打起来了……？而且还是和特级目标……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130009-EPILOGUE:20728:16","scriptId":20728,"text":"“兰布达！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1195,"speaker":"欧米伽","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"130009-EPILOGUE:20728:17","scriptId":20728,"text":"“我就想试试他们的实力罢了，毕竟连兰布达你都输给过他们，我是不能接受的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1195,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130009-EPILOGUE:20728:18","scriptId":20728,"text":"兰布达看了一样这边，淡淡地说道。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1195,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"130009-EPILOGUE:20728:19","scriptId":20728,"text":"“那你现在试完了吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1195,"speaker":"欧米伽","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"130009-EPILOGUE:20728:20","scriptId":20728,"text":"“确实还有点实力，不过谁输谁赢还不知道呢。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1195,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"130009-EPILOGUE:20728:21","scriptId":20728,"text":"“该走了，阿尔库涅大人还在等你的实验报告。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1195,"speaker":"欧米伽","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"130009-EPILOGUE:20728:22","scriptId":20728,"text":"“噫！？大人在等我？那这就动身。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1195,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130009-EPILOGUE:20728:23","scriptId":20728,"text":"欧米伽转身做了个鬼脸。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1195,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1195,"speaker":"欧米伽","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"130009-EPILOGUE:20728:24","scriptId":20728,"text":"“这次就算打平了，以后再找你们算账——","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1195,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130009-EPILOGUE:20728:25","scriptId":20728,"text":"话音未落，白色的强光包裹着两名旅行者，然后一下子就消失得无影无踪了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1195,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130009-EPILOGUE:20728:26","scriptId":20728,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1195,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130009-EPILOGUE:20728:27","scriptId":20728,"text":"“这算是什么情况？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130009-EPILOGUE:20728:28","scriptId":20728,"text":"“结束了呗，看来是欧米伽在瞎胡闹的样子……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130009-EPILOGUE:20728:29","scriptId":20728,"text":"“这……旅行者的行为真是难以理解。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130009-EPILOGUE:20728:30","scriptId":20728,"text":"“我的胃又疼了……这种报告要怎么写啊……还不如打个你死我活来得痛快……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":5,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
